      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK, so that problem is [this check](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/cc/check.go;l\u003d52;drc\u003d50858a72e05fc7bb6c4d68bce51f265aa459746b) preventing you from overriding the target. What about adding `if !ctx.Config().IsEnvTrue(\"ART_USE_SIMULATOR\") {` to the check ([example](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:build/soong/cc/check.go;l\u003d48-51;drc\u003d50858a72e05fc7bb6c4d68bce51f265aa459746b))? I\u0027m not sure it\u0027s the best way forward, but it looks like the easiest way to me. You may send a CL to ccross to see if he\u0027s okay with this idea.",
